window.products.push({"id":132128,"name":"Integra Boost RH 62% 2 Way Humidity Control (4 Gram - 24 Packets) + Twin Canaries Chart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mfuIaoE3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Use our 4-gram Integra Boost 2-way humidity control packs to control moisture in an enclosed area. Our patented technology will either release or absorb moisture, maintaining relative humidity at 62% in a contained environment. We include a smart, simple-to-read to Replacement Indicator Card with our Integra Boost packs. Simply replace the old pack with a fresh one when the dot on the Replacement Indicator Card turns bright blue. Twin Canaries Chart Included with Every Order!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mfuIaoE3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Twin Canaries Liquid Volume Conversion Chart","source_asin":"B07LFNG91H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LFNG91H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LFNG91H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":132129,"name":"8547174v Whirlpool 8547174 Idler Pulley Dryer Maytag PS11722120 AP5983811 8547174VP Kit WED6200SW1 WED6400SW0 WED6400SW1 WGD6600VW1 MED6300TQ0 MGD6300","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dtTbOOizS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡8547174v Idler Pulley - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP5983811, 8547174, 4248254, 8547174VP, PS11722120. The 8547174v Idler Pulley Kit includes pulley, shaft, and arm. Idler Pulley 8547174v is compatible with Whirlpool, Maytag appliances. The pulley is made of durable plastic, while the bracket is typically made of metal. The bearing that the pulley rotates on is typically made of metal as well, for added durability. It fits hundreds of models and can be easily installed. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Whirlpool Idler Pulley 8547174v? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. 8547174 Dryer Idler Pulley Whirlpool Part will help if your appliance is noisy, and doesn't tumble or start. Installing a new Whirlpool 8547174v Dryer Idler Pulley is typically a straightforward process that can be completed by a DIYer with basic tools. 💡 The Dryer Idler Pulley 8547174v is a component used in the dryer to provide tension to the dryer belt. When the dryer drum rotates, the belt turns along with it, and the idler pulley helps to keep the belt tight. The Maytag Dryer Idler Pulley 8547174v is mounted on a bracket attached to the dryer's motor and rotates on a bearing for smooth belt movement. 8547174 Pulley meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How long is the life span of an idler pulley? The lifespan of a Ultra Durable 8547174 Dryer Idler Pulley can vary depending on factors such as usage, maintenance, and the quality of the part itself. Generally, an idler pulley can last anywhere from 5 to 10 years or more with proper care and maintenance. If you notice any signs of wear or damage to your dryer idler pulley, it is important to replace the part with a new Maytag 8547174v, as soon as possible to avoid further damage to your dryer. 💡 What happens if you don't fix an idler pulley? A faulty or damaged idler pulley in a dryer can cause belt slippage, overheating, damage to other parts, and excessive noise. If left unaddressed, these issues can lead to further damage to the dryer and potential safety hazards such as fire. It is important to address any issues with the idler pulley as soon as possible to avoid costly repairs and potential safety risks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dtTbOOizS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07YFB57CP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YFB57CP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YFB57CP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
