window.products.push({"id":132283,"name":"OEM 4681EA2001T Washer Drain Pump Motor by Techecook - Fit for Kenmore & LG Washing Machine wm2101hw wm3270cw wm3431hs wm3770hva wm2075cw - Replaces A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NgJYPXkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【4681EA2001T WASHER DRAIN PUMP】4681EA2001T front load washer drain pump motor(OEM Part) removes water from the washer during the drain portion of the cycle and is quiet when running, which is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer. When Lg washer drain pump 4681EA2001T AP5328388 fails, you may need longer to dry, so you need to replace the 4681EA2001T M3379-65468 front load washer drain pump motor to get your washing machine back to normal ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】Including 1 x 4681EA2001T washer drain pump motor(OEM Part). Specifications: 120V-127V 60Hz 85W 1.4A 45L/Min. Complete pump and motor assembly along with removable filter housing for easier cleaning. Replacing AP5328388 lg washer pump motor can effectively solve the following common symptoms: ① Washer will not drain ②Washer pumps won’t spin ③Noisy cycles ④ Washer leaks ✔✔【365 DAYS WARRANTY】During the 365 days warranty period, if the OEM 4681EA2001T lg washing machine drain pump has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customers' satisfaction are our unremitting pursuit. Risk-free shopping. If you have any questions about our products or services, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to solve the problem. Amazon official logistics, your products will have a strong logistics guarantee ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODEL】4681EA2001T Washer Drain Pump fit for Ken-more and L-G washing machine wm2487hrma wm3170cw wm3600hva wm3431hs wm3570hwa wm3001hpa wm2010cw wm3050cw WM3500cw/01 wm3488hw wm2301hr wm4270hva wm3470hwa wm2077cw wm3987hw wm2101hw, etc. Replaces part numbers: 4681EA1007D, 4681EA1007G, 4681EA2001D, 4681EA2001N, 4681EA2001U, 2003273, AP5328388, PS3579318, EAP3579318. If you are not sure that your washer can fit the 4681EA2001T AP5328388 washer drain pump motor, please contact us ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】Before installing 4681EA2001T Drain Pump, you need prepare a phillips screwdriver, flat-blade screwdriver, needle nose pliers, slip-joint pliers and disconnect the power and water supply. Remove the drain cover on the cleaner, disconnect the wiring harness and two hoses on the drain pump assembly. Two washers on the tilted back leg. Loosen the two screws and disassemble the drain pump. Install a new one and tighten the screws.Connect hoses, wiring harnesses and gaskets","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NgJYPXkrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B0B9XMHG4H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9XMHG4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9XMHG4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
