window.products.push({"id":132508,"name":"134637810 Water Inlet Valve OEM by Blutoget (5 YEAR WARRANTY) - Compatible with Frigi-daire Ken-more Electrolux Crosley Washing Machine - Replaces 134","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zi+vPDYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝟏𝟑𝟒𝟔𝟑𝟕𝟖𝟏𝟎 𝑾𝒂𝒕𝒆𝒓 𝑰𝒏𝒍𝒆𝒕 𝑽𝒂𝒍𝒗𝒆 : Water inlet valve 134637810 OEM supplies water to the washing machine and allows you to control the amount of cold and hot water that goes into the machine.This part can become worn out.If this part is broken, it can cause problems with the flow of water into the washer. 134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve Replacement is a 4 coil valve. There is not a thermistor on valve. Water inlet valve 134637810 is not easy to leak to ensure long-term use. 𝑮𝑹𝑬𝑨𝑻 𝑽𝑨𝑳𝑼𝑬 𝑷𝑨𝑪𝑲 : Package includes 1 x 134637810 water inlet valve electrolux. The rated voltage is 120V 65Hz. Washer Water Inlet Valve 134637810 can fix the following symptoms: ①Your washer was leaking; ②Make noise; ③Will not drain; ④The clothes are wetter than usual; ⑤Pump but will not spin.134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve Assembly has an upgraded design, making electrolux 134637810 more durable and stable, maximizing usage time. High compatibility and adaptation. 𝟓 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀 : Risk-free shopping,134637810 Washer Water Inlet Valve is made of high-quality materials, it is not easy to leak, has a good seal, and is precisely matched to your washer.134637810 water inlet valve electrolux supports 5 YEAR WARRANTY return and exchange. We promise to ensure your absolute satisfaction with every purchase. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 𝑯𝑰𝑮𝑯 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑰𝑻𝒀 : 134637810 water inlet valve electrolux compatible Brands, Crosley, Electrolux, Frigi-daire, Ken-more etc.Replaces PD00000613,134637800, 7134637800, 7134637810 ,1482877, AP4368791, PS2349248, EAP2349248 etc. If you are not sure if 134637810 water inlet valve is suitable for your machine, please contact us and we will be happy to solve problem for you.134637810 water inlet valve electrolux is made of durable high quality ABS, designed to be more durable. 𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑻𝑶 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳 : Please be sure to unplug the power supply and turn off the water supply before install 134637810 water valve. Unscrew the two screws from the top of the back of the washing machine, then remove the top. Unscrew the counterweight and move it to the front. Loosen the electrical plug and swing the valve to ensure that the black rubber seal is reserved for the new valve. Following the relevant video for installation is an easier option.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zi+vPDYVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blutoget","source_asin":"B08RMKQ5VQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RMKQ5VQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RMKQ5VQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
