window.products.push({"id":132597,"name":"Dishwasher Corner Gaskets Replacement Part WD8X227 & WD8X228 for GE & Hotpoint Dishwashers - Replaces PS263963 PS263964 AP2038859 AP2038860","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BYgnlKgOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The corner tub baffle may also be known as the door baffle and is a part used on your dishwasher. It is black rubber and has a matching left/ right hand lower corner baffle. It is recommended that you replace and install both left and right at the same time. It will become evident that this part needs to be replaced if you are experiencing leaking or lack of draining. Fixes the following symptoms: * Leaking * Not draining * Not cleaning dishes properly. Replaces the following part numbers: For the left side WD8X227 - replaces AP2038859, 2364, H263963, EA263963, PS263963, WD08X0196, WD08X0227, WD8X196, 129D9420P05;  For the right side WD8X228 - replaces AP2038860, 2286, AH263964, EA263964, PS263964, WD08X0195, WD08X0228, WD8X195, 129D9420P06. Compatible models include but are not limited to: GE, Hotpoint, Kenmore, RCA, Magic Chef, Amana Kenmore: 36314031000, 36314038000, 36314071792, 36314071794, 36314075793, 36314081993, 36314192991, 36314194991, 36314194993, 36314391991, 36314395991 and more. GE:36314081991, PSD1000Z02WH, PSD100X-72WH, PSD100X-73WH, PSD1060K01, PSD200V-60BA, PSD200V-64BA, PSD2260K25, PSD300Y-70BA, GSD500T-55WA and more. Hotpoint:HDA110S-48WA, HDA2220Z02BB, HDA999M-20, HDA999M-25BA, HDA999M-35BA, HDA300Y-70BA, HDA2000G00WW and more. Installation Tips: This is a very easy repair that requires no tools. Open the dishwasher door and simply use your hands to remove the baffle found in the lower right hand side of the dishwasher. Clean out any dirt and insert your new one into place. Warm note: This is not original product the mention of any related model designation above is only for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BYgnlKgOL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reyhoar","source_asin":"B08JVJ6FV6","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JVJ6FV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JVJ6FV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":132598,"name":"WATOOR Commercial Ice Maker Machine with Bottom-Loading Water System, LCD Display Under Counter or ‎Freestanding 100lbs/24h","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":399.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mi+cDp4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIVE YOU THE BEST ICE - Equipped with a powerful 300W compressor, Commercial ice maker machine can produce 100 lbs of ice per day and comes with a storage container for 33 lbs of ice. The automatic overflow prevention of the ice machine maker also allows you not to worry about ice cubes overflow. This ice maker portable alone can meet the amount of ice cubes your entire family and commercial needs. BOTTOM-LOADING OR CONNECT WATER LINE - This ice maker is equipped with the Bottom-loading water system which is suitable for 3-5 gallon water bottles . You can also connect water line to add water. MULTI-FUNCTION CONTROL PANEL - The ice maker machine commercial is equipped with a smart LCD panel. Any function and any operation can be solved in the control panel. The panel shows the temperature of the environment, reminding you to pay attention to the temperature of the surrounding environment to ensure the efficiency of ice making. You can adjust the size of ice cubes by adjusting the ice making time. The industrial ice machine will clean automatically when you press the clean button. EFFICIENT & QUIET - The powerful compressor allows the under counter ice machine to complete the ice making process efficiently without causing too much noise. High efficiency and low noise provide you with a comfortable environment to enjoy your high-quality ice. At the same time, Watoor industrial ice maker has an energy certificate to help you save electricity bills. CLEANING - INCREASE THE LIFE OF YOUR ICE MAKER - Watoor recommends that you clean the machine regularly according to the usage. Requires water supply and drain (GRAVITY DRAINAGE). SUGGEST-Drain water once a day(PULLING OUT THE SMALL HOSE ON THE RIGHT SIDE OF THE WATER TANK). Be sure to keep ice machine upright for at least 24 hours before using it. Also, press the \"Timer Clean\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter the \"Cleaning Program\" to clean it twice before making the first batch of ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mi+cDp4SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATOOR","source_asin":"B09HC5FGJX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HC5FGJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HC5FGJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":132599,"name":"Whirlpool WP8181694 Top Load Washer Water Inlet Valve","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61krdyCPxlL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"This Top Load Washer Water Inlet Valve lets the hot and cold water into your washing machine and distributes it around to the dispensers. If the valve is leaking or the solenoids are damaged and water isn't coming in, replacing this part may alleviate these issues. Usually, a long or slow fill cycle is often due to a restricted water valve. To access the part, after shutting off the water supply, remove the hot and cold fill hoses (usually labeled \"H\" and \"C\") at the back of the machine from the valve. Be sure to set a towel down to catch any water. You'll then remove the top panel of the washer. Please note: The valve should never be disassembled and cleaned, only replaced. Replacing this part will require basic hand tools, some disassembly of the appliance and novice repair experience. You must unplug the appliance or shut off the house circuit breaker before installing this part. Also make sure you turn off the hot and cold water supplies. Helpful Tip: We also recommend using affresh Washing Machine Cleaner Tablets (item W10135699) once a month to help reduce odor-causing residue that can build up in your washing machine's drain without proper care. affresh brand products are owned and distributed by Whirlpool Corporation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61krdyCPxlL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B07B9FG1CC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B9FG1CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B9FG1CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
