window.products.push({"id":132710,"name":"ARLIME Countertop Ice Maker Machine, 45 Lbs/24H, 24 Pcs/13 Mins, 2 Ways to Add Water, Compact Ice Machine with Ice Scoop & Basket, Self-Cleaning Porta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715kexPA54L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍋 【13 Mins Faster Ice Making】 - High efficient countertop ice maker machine takes only 13 minutes to get 24 delicious ice cubes per cycle. Just use the scoop to break it up. It can produce up to 44lbs of ice in 24 hours. Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs, letting you create perfect drinks. Whether it's summer or winter the ice maker helps keep food fresh, creat cold drinks, cool beers, and is the foundation of smoothies, drinks, cold food. 🍋 【2 Ways to Add Water - Bottle Not Included】 - The ice maker supports two ways of adding water, manual or bottled water supply. The countertop ice maker machine holds up to 3.2 liters of water, so you don’t have to manually fill with water as often. Suitable for 0.5-3 Gal（2-11L）bottled water in supermarkets. Easily moving the ice maker as needed with size 14*10*15in, and it can also be used with various countertops. Most popular in the office, restaurant, bars, stores, home, outdoor parties. 🍋 【Smarter 24H Timer & Self-Cleaning】 - Press \"CLEAN\" button for more than 5 seconds to enter 20 minutes of thorough self-cleaning. Featuring a 24H timer, the self-cleaning ice maker can be set to stop before midnight and restart next morning by the timer function. When you wake up in the morning or get home from work in the evening, You can get a lot of ice from the ice machine immediately. A clear indicator on the LCD screen for ice full and water shortage remind. 🍋 【High-quality & Food-Safe Material】 - Euipped with thickened foam layer and high quality compressor, the stainless steel ice maker is the use of Food-Safe material, can effectively protect the ice from melting. The appearance is smooth and easy to clean, we recommend that when the machine is not used for a long time, to avoid mold, be sure to wash it first and then ensure that the inside of the machine is dry before storing it. Besides, this Ice Maker's low noise will not disturb your rest. 🍋 【12-MONTH WARRANTY & LIFETIME TECH SUPPORT】- All of our ice machines are covered by a 12-month warranty and lifetime tech support. Each portable ice maker is equipped with an ice basket and an ice shovel. Please make sure that these accessories are fully equipped when you receive it, and if there are any missing, please contact us. Easy and fast replacement is guaranteed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715kexPA54L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B09RHVXMVW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RHVXMVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RHVXMVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
