window.products.push({"id":132895,"name":"NXR SCD3611 36 in. 5.5 cu.ft. professional style Dual Fuel Gas Range with 6 burners & Convection Oven in Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":2209.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T-4pf0cQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The NXR SC Series Dual Fuel Range is a 36 dual fuel range model with an all stainless steel professional style. The duel fuel range is designed to be the centerpiece of your kitchen,bringing the look and feel of a commercial restaurant-style range into your home.The six single stack burners are German engineered to be sealed, specially made to handle any type of cooking. It comes with a gas stove and electric oven, combining the benefits of both in one. The 36 inch dual fuel range comes in a sleek design loaded with multiple features that make your cooking experience fun and effortless. The duel fuel stove features flat heavy duty grates and the versatility of both high power and ultra low simmer. Boil water quickly with the higher power 18,000 BTU, simmer delicate sauces with the low power 6,000 BTU and everything in between. It comes with a dual fuel oven with extra-smooth full extension glide oven racks. The 36 dual fuel range even has a PC board that monitors the temperature. The re-ignition system is all about safety and will protect against gas buildup. The stainless steel dual fuel stove is engineered by top suppliers with top quality material. The convection fan will circulate air to promote even cooking, instantly boosting your baking repertoire. It’ll be like using a stove double gas oven. The oven offers a lot of space to do your favorite baking. You can consistently bake cakes and cookies with browning perfectly even across baking sheets. Its controls are easy to use and clear to see due to its large knobs. Its heavy-duty silver accent knobs, hinges, and towel-bar handle complete the professional look and feel of this exceptional 36-inch range. It’s the best dual fuel range that will help you wow your family!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51T-4pf0cQS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NXR","source_asin":"B092YVKY5R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092YVKY5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B092YVKY5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
