window.products.push({"id":132940,"name":"134503600 Dryer Belt Frigidaire Kenmore Drum Drive AP3865318 PS1148434 Part Electrolux Replacement Number 417.61712510 417.61722510 417.83142300 417.9","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519f0-I8aPS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Dryer Belt 134503600 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP3865318, 1156784, 134163400, 134163500, 148270, 148270-000, 5303283471, AH1148434, EA1148434, F148270-000, F1482740-000, PS1148434. Dryer Drum Belt 134503600 is compatible with Frigidaire, Crosley, Electrolux, Gibson, Kelvinator, Kenmore, Tappan, Westinghouse appliances. The Belt 134503600 is made of rubber and has a ribbed surface to provide better grip and traction to rotate the drum. It fits hundreds of models. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the 134503600 Belt? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Frigidaire 134503600 will help if your appliance is noisy, doesn't tumble, doesn't start, or there is no/not enough heat. Drive Belt 134503600 is designed to be easy to install and fits securely around the drum and motor pulley. Make sure to unplug the dryer before starting the repair. 💡 The Frigidaire Dryer Belt 134503600 also known as the drive belt, is a component in dryers that is responsible for rotating the drum where your clothes are placed. It loops around the drum, idler pulley, and motor pulley. When the motor armature rotates, the 134503600 Frigidaire Dryer Drum Belt rotates the drum, which causes your clothes to tumble and dry. 134503600 Dryer Drum Belt meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are there different dryer belts? Yes, there are different dryer belts, as they come in different sizes, shapes, and materials. Dryer belts are used to drive the drum in the dryer, and their size and type depend on the specific model of the dryer. Some dryer belts are made of rubber, while others are made of reinforced fabric or other materials. Some dryer belts are flat, while others are grooved or ribbed. Choosing the appropriate belt that matches the specific model of your dryer is crucial. 💡 Will a dryer run without a belt? No, a dryer will not run without a belt. The dryer belt is a crucial component that is responsible for rotating the drum in which the clothes are placed. Without the belt, the drum cannot rotate, and the dryer will not function properly. If it breaks or becomes worn out, it should be replaced promptly to avoid further damage to the dryer. Attempting to operate the dryer without a belt can cause damage to the motor, bearings, or other components of the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519f0-I8aPS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07NH8K73Z","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-132940","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NH8K73Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NH8K73Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
